      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washington%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Historic Washington Foundation, founded in 1958, preserves the town’s 19th‑century architecture and history.",
